  "_mapping_notes": {
    "sql_to_json": "Each SQL table maps to a top-level JSON object. Foreign keys (sender_id, receiver_id, category_id) are resolved into nested objects rather than left as raw integers, since API consumers (web/chart_handler.js) need display-ready data, not IDs to look up. The Transaction_Category_Map junction table is flattened into a 'categories' array on the transaction object -- the M:N relationship becomes a list rather than a separate resource."
  },

